6. Free trial and subscription. The free trial lasts 14 days, needs no payment card and is limited to one per person and per computer. After it you
   can subscribe monthly or yearly at the price shown in the program. A subscription renews automatically for the same period until you cancel
   it in the program (Settings, About, Subscription); you keep access until the end of the period you paid for. If a trial or subscription
   ends, the program stays installed and your data stays yours: it opens read-only, so you can look at everything and export it, but not add or
   change things until you subscribe again. Refunds follow the refund policy on mytcgpro.com. Licences bought earlier as a one-time purchase
   stay valid.

7. Termination. The licence ends at once if you break this agreement. You must then stop using the program and delete all copies.

